  Bootable Claude Code Environment for Linux Rescue & Debugging

  Quick Start:
    claude          Launch Claude Code (interactive AI assistant)
    rescue-claude   Launch Claude with rescue context (mounts, diagnostics)
    startx          Start i3 desktop environment (terminal + browser)
    nmtui           Connect to WiFi interactively
    claude-reauth   Re-authenticate Claude Code

  Useful Commands:
    lsblk           List block devices
    mount /dev/X /mnt  Mount a partition for inspection
    arch-chroot /mnt   Chroot into a mounted Arch installation
    journalctl -D /mnt/var/log/journal  Read logs from mounted system

